    "turn_idx": 114,
    "turn_text": "Well, well, well, well, exactly. I mean, that's related to my question, but you, you know, that moment in 94 when the Gingrich Revolution happened was a hinge moment in certain ways. And I'm wondering what you've seen over the years in the way Congress works and doesn't work in the sort of partisanization of the process and the sort of acrimony that we've seen grow up over time.",
