    "turn_text": "We're going to take another short break and we'll be back with Governor Jay Inslee. Another issue that's come to the fore and you mentioned it earlier is DACA and what we do about these young people who are the children of undocumented immigrants and through no fault of their own now find themselves in this no man's land and under threat of being returned to countries they never knew because of the decision of the administration and the Obama order. What are the implications of that decision and how likely do you think it is that Congress will in fact step in and deal with this problem?",
