        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Witnessing dreamers' determination evoked a strong emotional response in the speaker.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "A state-level Dream Act providing financial aid to dreamers was passed in Washington State on a bipartisan basis.",
